  "title": "Warm Wok-Seared Thai Morcilla Stir-fry",
  "description": "A delicious and kid-friendly Thai dish featuring morcilla, bonito-shave, and a variety of vegetables. Serve immediately over steamed jasmine rice.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
