  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large kazak (cauldron) over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the shallot and Thai red chilies and stir-fry until the shallot is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the morcilla and stir-fry, breaking it up with a spatula, until it is no longer pink.",
    "Add the bonito flakes, fish sauce, and palm sugar and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced vegetables and stir-fry until they are tender-crisp.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the stir-fry to a serving platter and garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately over steamed jasmine rice."
  ],
